        <item>
            <title>0.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 22:22:30 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The inspector for BitTorrent tasks now has Trackers, Peers and Files tabs.</li>
  <li>Trackers tab: view each tracker's status, add, edit or remove trackers, and reannounce manually.</li>
  <li>Peers tab: view connected peers and the transfer speed of each.</li>
  <li>Files tab: choose which files to download.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
